[
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:0.1"], "en": "The Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:0.2", "PA_ja_517:0.3"], "en": "The Section of Thirty Birth Stories, Chapter on Kiṁchanda.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:0.4"], "en": "7. The Jātaka of the Water-Demon (Dakarakkhasa) “If,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:1.1", "PA_ja_517:1.2"], "en": "while you seven are being carried away in the ocean, [you should pray:]”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:1.3"], "en": "Seeking human flesh,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:1.4"], "en": "a rākṣasa might seize a boat;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:1.5"], "en": "having spoken words in gradual sequence, [he would cause it to sink].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:1.6"], "en": "“...you will be released from the water-demon.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.1"], "en": "“One should give one’s mother first;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.2"], "en": "having given one’s wife, then one’s brother;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.3"], "en": "Then, having given my companion,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.4"], "en": "I would give the fifth, the brahmin;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.5"], "en": "on the sixth day, I would give myself.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:2.6"], "en": "I will not give you the Mahosadha herb.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:3.1", "PA_ja_517:3.2"], "en": "“Your mother who nourished you, who has been compassionate toward you for a long time;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:3.3", "PA_ja_517:3.4"], "en": "The wise woman, who perceives her own welfare, does not harbor ill will toward you;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:3.5"], "en": "having established another basis for her conduct, she remains steadfast.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:3.6"], "en": "He liberated her from execution—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:4.1"], "en": "her who was such a giver of life,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:4.2"], "en": "his own flesh-and-blood mother who bore him in her womb.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:4.3"], "en": "“For what fault would you give away your mother,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:4.4"], "en": "O protector of the water?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:5.1"], "en": "“She is young and adorned with ornaments;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:5.2"], "en": "She wears ornaments and jewelry;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:5.3", "PA_ja_517:5.4"], "en": "she laughs excessively at the gatekeepers and the soldiers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:6.1", "PA_ja_517:6.2"], "en": "Furthermore, he himself issues commands to the messengers of rival kings; because of that offense,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:6.3"], "en": "he [kills] his mother.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:6.4"], "en": "“I would give [it] to you, O protector of the water.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:7.1"], "en": "“She is the most excellent of women,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:7.2"], "en": "speaking with words of extreme affection;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:7.3"], "en": "Ever-faithful and virtuous,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:7.4"], "en": "she follows like a shadow that never departs;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:8.1"], "en": "free from anger and possessed of merit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:8.2"], "en": "\"You are wise and see what is beneficial;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:8.3", "PA_ja_517:8.4"], "en": "for what fault would you give Ubbari to the water-protectors?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:9.1"], "en": "“Engrossed in the pleasure of play,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:9.2"], "en": "she has fallen into a state of ruin;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:9.3"], "en": "she [will be] among her own sons— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:9.4"], "en": "He begs for wealth from one who begs.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:10.1", "PA_ja_517:10.2"], "en": "Full of passion, I give him much wealth of various kinds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:10.3"], "en": "Having given away what was very difficult to give,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:10.4"], "en": "I later grieve with a dejected mind;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:10.5"], "en": "because of that fault, O Ubbarī, I am tormented.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:10.6"], "en": "\"I would give [them] to you, O protector of the gift.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:11.1", "PA_ja_517:11.2"], "en": "\"By whom the provinces were gathered and brought as an offering...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:11.3", "PA_ja_517:11.4"], "en": "Having overcome many riches brought from foreign realms,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:12.1"], "en": "[he gave them] to the most excellent of archers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:12.2"], "en": "Why, O protector of the gift,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:12.3"], "en": "would you give away your brother,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:12.4"], "en": "who is brave, sharp-witted, and eloquent?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:13.1"], "en": "“By whom countries were plundered,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:13.2", "PA_ja_517:13.3"], "en": "and who brought [booty] as a gift; that which was carried away from foreign realms— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:13.4"], "en": "Having set out with much wealth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:14.1"], "en": "he was a preeminent archer,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:14.2"], "en": "a hero with a sharp blade.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:14.3"], "en": "\"This king, though happy,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:14.4"], "en": "despises me as a mere child;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:15.1"], "en": "even my attendance upon him, noble lady— \"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:15.2"], "en": "\"He does not come as he did before;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:15.3", "PA_ja_517:15.4"], "en": "because of that fault, I would give my brother to the water-protectors.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:16.1"], "en": "“In a single night,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:16.2"], "en": "both you and the archery teacher—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:16.3"], "en": "both were born here among the Pañcālas.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:16.4"], "en": "Your companions are of similar age;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.1"], "en": "your conduct followed after you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.2"], "en": "sharing in your very same suffering and happiness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.3"], "en": "Anxious day and night,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.4"], "en": "occupied with all your duties—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.5"], "en": "by what fault do you have no companion?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:17.6"], "en": "“Give it to me, you protector of wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:18.1"], "en": "“This is my way of life, noble lady;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:18.2"], "en": "you have laughed with me.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:18.3"], "en": "Even today, because of that color,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:18.4"], "en": "she laughs excessively.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:19.1"], "en": "O Noble Lady, I am indeed the wife here.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:19.2"], "en": "I speak in private;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:19.3"], "en": "he enters uninvited,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:19.4"], "en": "having not been previously announced.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:20.1"], "en": "Having gained access and obtained an opportunity,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:20.2", "PA_ja_517:20.3"], "en": "he becomes a companion to that fault— shamelessness and lack of respect.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:20.4"], "en": "“I would give [it] to you, O protector of the water.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:21.1", "PA_ja_517:21.2"], "en": "[He replied: “I am skilled in all signs, a knower of sounds, one who has mastered the traditional teachings;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:21.3"], "en": "Applicable to portents and dreams,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:21.4", "PA_ja_517:22.1"], "en": "to going forth and entering; the path on earth and in the sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:22.2"], "en": "Skilled in the lunar mansions,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:22.3", "PA_ja_517:22.4"], "en": "for what fault would you give a brahmin who guards his sacrificial fee?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:23.1"], "en": "“Even when the assembly is present, O Noble Lady,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:23.2"], "en": "he gazes with eyes wide open;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:23.3"], "en": "therefore, [I see] that fierce hunter as exceedingly radiant.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:23.4"], "en": "I would give it to you, O protector of the water.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:24.1", "PA_ja_517:24.2"], "en": "[He replied: “The earth, bounded by the oceans and girt by the seas;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:24.3"], "en": "You dwell upon the earth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:24.4"], "en": "surrounded by your ministers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:25.1"], "en": "you possess a great kingdom extending to its four borders.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:25.2"], "en": "A victor of great power,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:25.3"], "en": "you were the sole king of the earth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:25.4"], "en": "your fame has spread far and wide.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:26.1"], "en": "Sixteen thousand women,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:26.2"], "en": "adorned with earrings of strung jewels,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:26.3"], "en": "were ladies from various lands.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:26.4"], "en": "Beautiful as celestial maidens,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:27.1", "PA_ja_517:27.2"], "en": "thus endowed with every limb and perfected in all desires;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:27.3", "PA_ja_517:27.4"], "en": "\"O Kṣatriya, they say that for those who are happy, life is long and dear;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:28.1"], "en": "but by what reason do you [say otherwise]?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:28.2"], "en": "Or for what reason,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:28.3"], "en": "protecting the wise man,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:28.4"], "en": "do you sacrifice a life that is so difficult to give?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:29.1", "PA_ja_517:29.2"], "en": "“Even though Mahosadha came into my hand, O Noble Lady,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:29.3"], "en": "I do not recall [any fault] of that wise man.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:29.4"], "en": "Even a slight misdeed [is an offense].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:30.1", "PA_ja_517:30.2"], "en": "And if at any time my death should come before [that];", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:30.3", "PA_ja_517:30.4"], "en": "Thus Mahosadha would bring happiness to my sons and grandsons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:31.1"], "en": "regarding both the future and the present.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:31.2"], "en": "He sees even the smallest thing;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:31.3", "PA_ja_517:31.4"], "en": "he would not give away one who guards the water when their actions are blameless.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:32.1"], "en": "“Listen to this, O Pañcālas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:32.2"], "en": "the speech of Cūḷaneyya:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:32.3"], "en": "‘One who protects a wise man, …’”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:32.4"], "en": "He gives up his life, which is so difficult to give up—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:33.1"], "en": "for the sake of his mother, his wife, his brother,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:33.2"], "en": "his friend, and even for a brahmin.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:33.3"], "en": "Even for his own sake,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:33.4"], "en": "Pañcāla gives up his life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:34.1"], "en": "Thus, wisdom is of great benefit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:34.2"], "en": "She is skillful and thinks rightly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_517:34.3", "PA_ja_517:34.4"], "en": "for the sake of welfare in this very life and for happiness in the future world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
